# =============================================================================
# Nothing derived from individual participants belongs in this repository.
# =============================================================================
# The AMORIS data are restricted (see README.md) and cannot be redistributed.
# Only code and aggregate documentation are tracked here. The patterns below
# are a safety net, not a substitute for checking what you are committing:
# run `git status` and look at every file before you stage it.

# --- Individual-level files produced by the pipeline -------------------------
# One row per participant. Never commit these.
table1_kdmgroups_baseline*.csv
sampleIDs_baseline.csv
training_set_baseline.csv
*_perID.csv
*_perid.csv

# --- Output directory -------------------------------------------------------
# Where config.R sends tables, intermediate files and figures.
output/
Output/

# --- Source data and R workspaces -------------------------------------------
# Workspaces can hold the full participant-level cohort.
*.sas7bdat
*.RData
*.rdata
*.rda
*.rds
*.RDS
*.sav
*.dta

# --- Run artefacts ----------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.Rout
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.nb.html
*_cache/
*_files/

# --- OS / editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~

# --- Generated results documents ---------------------------------------------
# plot_cif_results.R writes the estimates behind the figures into this file.
README_cif_figures.md
